  "event_translations": [
    {
      "original": "各位好，先说一声今晚聚会的事：我这边的素食忌口从现在起取消了，现在什么都能吃，选店的时候不用再专门为我找素食菜单，常规菜单我也没问题。",
      "english": "Hi everyone, a quick update for tonight's get-together: I no longer need a vegetarian meal. A regular menu is fine, so you don't need to look for a vegetarian menu for me."
    },
    {
      "original": "【门店公告】Bonne Bouche Paddington（129 Praed St）因厨房设备突发故障，今天 12:30 起暂停营业，今日剩余时段堂食与外带均不接待，已预约的顾客请联系店员改期，明早 7:00 恢复正常营业。",
      "english": "Bonne Bouche Paddington (129 Praed St): due to an unexpected kitchen equipment fault, we are closed from 12:30 for the rest of today. Dine-in and takeaway are unavailable. If you have a reservation, please contact us to reschedule. We reopen at 07:00 tomorrow."
    }
  ],
